// Title: LSASS Process Dump Artefact In CrashDumps Folder
// Rule ID: 6902955a-01b7-432c-b32a-6f5f81d8f625
// Severity: high
// Tags: attack.credential-access, attack.t1003.001
// Category: file_event
// Product: windows
// Pipeline: azure_monitor
// Source: /home/user/Sigma_KQL/sigma_rules/rules/windows/file/file_event/file_event_win_lsass_shtinkering.yml
//
// Generated by sigma-to-kql converter
